  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 13 + 4 ÷ 16 × 5 - 22 = 11.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 13 and 22\n\nGiven: 13 + 4 ÷ 16 × 5 - 22 = 11\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 22 + __**4 ÷ 16**__ × 5 - 13 = 11\n\n⇒ 22 + __**0.25 × 5**__ - 13 = 11\n\n⇒ __**22 + 1**.25__ - 13 = 11\n\n⇒ __23.25 - 13__ = 11\n\n⇒ 10.25 ≠ 11\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 16 and 22\n\nGiven: 13 + 4 ÷ 16 × 5 - 22 = 11\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 13 + __**4 ÷ 22 × 5**__ - 16 = 11\n\n⇒ __**13 + **____0.90__ - 16 = 11\n\n⇒ __**13.90 - 16**__ = 11\n\n⇒ -2.10 ≠ 11\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 13 and 16\n\nGiven: 13 + 4 ÷ 16 × 5 - 22 = 11\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 16 + __**4 ÷ 13 × 5**__ - 22 = 11\n\n⇒ __**16 + **____1.54__ - 22 = 11\n\n⇒ __17.54____** - 22**__ = 11\n\n⇒ -4.46 ≠ 11\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 4 and 16\n\nGiven: 13 + 4 ÷ 16 × 5 - 22 = 11\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 13 + __**16 ÷ 4**__ × 5 - 22 = 11\n\n⇒ 13 + __4____** × 5**__ - 22 = 11\n\n⇒ __**13 + **__**__20__** - 22 = 11\n\n⇒ __33____ - 22__ = 11\n\n⇒ **11 = 11**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
